# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRE A SPECIFIC TERRAFORM VERSION OR HIGHER
# This module uses terraform 0.12 syntax and features that are available only since version 0.12.6, however
# we now depend on a bug fix released in 0.12.7.
